  "summary": "Windshield wiper motor, wiper transmissions (pivots and linkage), arms and blades, plus the park valve that controls the vacuum wiper door, all models. The motor [5] mounts to the dash panel (firewall) over gasket [4] with nuts [6]; the LH and RH transmissions [3] are held at the cowl by nuts [6] and carry the wiper arms [2] and blades [1]. The valve [7] is screwed to bracket [12] on the plenum (nut [11], rivet [10], reinforcement [9], sealer around the studs), and a cushion [14] is glued to the wiper stop bracket on the dash panel; the washer hose is held by clip [15] and clamp [16].",
